# AWS S3 配置模板

```json
{
  "name": "aws-s3",
  "description": "AWS S3 存储配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "service": "aws-s3",
  "config": {
    "region": "us-east-1",
    "bucket": "my-bucket",
    "acl": "private",
    "cors": {
      "AllowedHeaders": ["*"],
      "AllowedMethods": ["GET", "PUT", "POST"],
      "AllowedOrigins": ["https://example.com"],
      "MaxAgeSeconds": 3000
    },
    "lifecycle": {
      "rules": [
        {
          "id": "ArchiveOldObjects",
          "status": "Enabled",
          "prefix": "logs/",
          "transitions": [
            {"days": 30, "storageClass": "STANDARD_IA"},
            {"days": 90, "storageClass": "GLACIER"}
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "cliCommands": {
    "list": "aws s3 ls",
    "upload": "aws s3 cp file.txt s3://bucket/",
    "download": "aws s3 cp s3://bucket/file.txt ./",
    "sync": "aws s3 sync dir/ s3://bucket/"
  },
  "envVars": {
    "AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID": "Access Key",
    "AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY": "Secret Key",
    "AWS_DEFAULT_REGION": "Region"
  }
}
```

## 文件位置
`templates/cloud/aws/s3-config.json`
